Error [E0927]: `#Uninit` is retired — it no longer does anything
  --> tests/ui/E0927_retired_marker.jet:7:7
    |
  7 |     #[Uninit]
    |       ^^^^^^
 Why: `#Uninit` used to be a real marker; it was removed and nothing takes its place under that name, so writing it here silently did nothing before this check existed.
 Fix: give the field a real initial value — stored uninitialized-sentinel fields were retired outright (D-UNINIT-SENTINEL1).
